data: {"id": "6171f679b89a404b-thinking-parallel_evidence-86", "run_id": "6171f679b89a404b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "kubectl_events", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "kubectl_events 摘要:\n关键诊断行:\n36m (x2 over 37m)       Warning   Unhealthy        Pod/workload   Readiness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.36:18080/ready\": dial tcp 172.16.104.36:18080: connect: conne", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789393413597, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "entity": {"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v17", "name": "workload"}, "dimension": "kubernetes"}, "tool_call_id": "call_19285b8487034af9846301fd", "tool_sequence": 3, "semantic_success": true, "result": "kubectl_events 摘要:\n关键诊断行:\n36m (x2 over 37m)       Warning   Unhealthy        Pod/workload   Readiness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.36:18080/ready\": dial tcp 172.16.104.36:18080: connect: connection refused\n17m (x23 over 37m)      Warning   Unhealthy        Pod/workload   Liveness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.36:18080/health\": context deadline exceeded (Client.Timeout exceeded while awaiting headers)\n2m29s (x147 over 35m)   Warning   BackOff          Pod/workload   Back-off restarting failed container app in pod workload_aiops-case-v17(85aece07-6ffa-41db-9e5a-f351771a8864)\n36m (x3 over 37m)       Normal    Killing          Pod/workload   Container app failed liveness probe, will be restarted", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/6171f679b89a404b-g1/tools/004-evidence-kubectl_events.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/6171f679b89a404b-g1/tools/004-evidence-kubectl_events.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/6171f679b89a404b-g1/tools/004-evidence-kubectl_events.summary.txt"}

event: thinking
data: {"id": "6171f679b89a404b-thinking-parallel_evidence-87", "run_id": "6171f679b89a404b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "kubectl_describe", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "Pod workload in namespace aiops-case-v17 is in CrashLoopBackOff (Restart Count: 17). Container 'app' (python:3-alpine) exits with code 137 (OOMKilled) repeatedly. Liveness probe fails with 'context de", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789393423889, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "entity": {"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v17", "name": "workload"}, "dimension": "kubernetes"}, "tool_call_id": "call_83eb08a4e829414099bac293", "tool_sequence": 1, "semantic_success": true, "result": "Pod workload in namespace aiops-case-v17 is in CrashLoopBackOff (Restart Count: 17). Container 'app' (python:3-alpine) exits with code 137 (OOMKilled) repeatedly. Liveness probe fails with 'context deadline exceeded' due to slow /health endpoint (3s sleep > 1s timeout), while Readiness probe shows 'connection refused' intermittently. Pod status is Running but Ready is False.\nkey_facts: [\"Name: workload\", \"Namespace: aiops-case-v17\", \"Node: node2/10.2.0.50\", \"Pod IP: 172.16.104.36\", \"Container: app (image: xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine)\", \"Status: Running\", \"Ready: False\", \"Restart Count: 17\", \"Last State: Terminated, Reason: Error, Exit Code: 137\", \"Limits: cpu=200m, memory=64Mi\", \"Liveness Probe: http://:18080/health, timeout=1s, Period=5s\", \"Readiness Probe: http://:18080/ready, timeout=1s, Period=3s\", \"Warning Unhealthy 17m (x23): Liveness probe failed: Get \\\"http://172.16.104.36:18080/health\\\": context deadline exceeded\", \"Warning Unhealthy 36m (x2): Readiness probe failed: connection refused\", \"Warning BackOff 2m29s (x147): Back-off restarting failed container\"]\nconflicts: [\"Current summary implies OOM due to exit code 137 mention but omits the specific probe timeout details present in raw_preview. Raw preview clarifies the liveness probe failure is due to timeout (context deadline exceeded) caused by app sleep(3) > timeout 1s, whereas readiness shows connection refused. Current summary lists both warnings but raw_preview provides the exact timing and frequency counts.\"]", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/6171f679b89a404b-g1/tools/005-evidence-kubectl_describe.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/6171f679b89a404b-g1/tools/005-evidence-kubectl_describe.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/6171f679b89a404b-g1/tools/005-evidence-kubectl_describe.summary.txt"}

