示进程崩溃退出，说明进程在健康时突然崩溃。\n3.  **OOM 证据缺失**：尽管存在 `Exit 137` 且内存限制仅 64Mi (Fact 11)，Metric (Fact 4) 却未提供 OOMKilled 状态，且缺少 `container_memory_working_set_bytes` 峰值数据，导致无法通过 Metrics 确诊 OOM。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用响应慢 (/health 耗时 ~3s) → 触发 Liveness Probe 超时 → kubelet 判定不健康 (Fact 2, 7) → 发送 SIGKILL 终止容器进程 (事实：liveness probe kill) → Exit Code 137 (Fact 3) → CrashLoopBackOff (Fact 1)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**证据不足**，无法确诊根因。\n\n现有证据在 \"OOM 导致崩溃\" 和 \"Liveness Probe 超时触发 Kill\" 两种假说间存在冲突：\n1.  **支持 OOM 的嫌疑**：内存限制极低 (64Mi)，Exit Code 137 常见于 OOM。\n2.  **支持 Probe Kill 的嫌疑**：Tracing (Fact 7) 显示 `/health` 耗时极长，直接解释了 K8s Event (Fact 2) 中的探针超时，且 OOM 通常会导致应用无响应（而日志显示 200 OK），这与 Probe Kill 机制（在进程存活但无响应时杀进程）更为吻合。\n\n**缺失决定性事实：**\n*   缺少 `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason` 为 `OOMKilled` 的直接证据。\n*   缺少 `container_memory_working_set_bytes` 峰值数据以排除 OOM。\n*   缺乏直接排除 `liveness probe` 配置值与响应时间之间关系的证据。\n\n*注：尽管 `formal_rca` 提示了 Exit 137 的矛盾，但因缺少决定性事实，无法发布最终结论。*\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 91.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v17/workload: 91.3s (Evidence 82.5s, RCA 8.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 16.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v17/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 127.901, "metrics": {"run_id": "6171f679b89a404b", "mttr": {"value": "2.1m", "seconds": 127.9201729297638, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 127920.1729297638, "llm_calls": 16, "llm_duration_ms": 109904.31380271912, "tool_calls": 20, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 6, "successful_tool_calls": 19, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 49057.51991271973, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 17409.587860107422}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 20334.58185195923, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 91347.70607948303, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 16203.930139541626, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

